WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-08 - Unhandled Exception
NOTE Artist: Crimson Node
NOTE Album: 2002: Crimson Node

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.500
[Instrumental Intro: Cold Echoing Piano & Slow Atmospheric Synth]

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:22.500
The screen went dark without a single sound

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:28.394
I'm searching for a signal that cannot be found

00:00:31.136 --> 00:00:37.500
I checked the routing, I ran the trace

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:43.302
But there is just a shadow in your physical space

00:00:45.703 --> 00:00:50.226
No warning lights, no system alert

00:00:52.948 --> 00:00:57.791
Just the sudden, silent gravity of the hurt

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:05.500
It's an unhandled exception in the dead of the night

00:01:07.108 --> 00:01:13.800
A catastrophic failure, a fading of the light

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:19.000
I'm reaching through the wire, but the endpoint is gone

00:01:19.056 --> 00:01:26.681
How do I process when the system stays on?

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:39.200
[Beat Drop: Fast 130 BPM Snare Drum & Pulsing Bassline]

00:01:39.558 --> 00:01:44.500
The phalanx is ready, but there's nothing to fight!

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:51.800
You can't build a wall against the absence of light!

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:56.800
Player Two holds my hand as the temperature drops

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:01.800
We wait for the ping... but the heartbeat just stops!

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:06.800
I keep checking the dictionary, line by line

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:11.000
Begging the beeper for a single sign!

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:18.275
It's an unhandled exception in the dead of the night!

00:02:19.196 --> 00:02:23.800
A catastrophic failure, a fading of the light!

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:32.188
I'm reaching through the wire, but the endpoint is gone

00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:38.200
How do I process when the system stays on?!

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.907
I don't care about the network, I don't care about the code!

00:02:41.967 --> 00:02:45.751
I am just a broken man at the end of the road!

00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:49.333
I never got to say goodbye, I never understood why

00:02:49.353 --> 00:02:52.756
I am sitting in the wreckage just watching the sky!

00:02:53.377 --> 00:02:59.602
It just hurts! God, it hurts that you're gone!

00:03:00.242 --> 00:03:03.285
And I don't know how I am supposed to move on!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:34.000
[Guitar Solo]

00:03:34.356 --> 00:03:42.500
It's an unhandled exception in the dead of the night!

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:48.500
A catastrophic failure, a fading of the light!

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:56.500
I'm reaching through the wire, but the endpoint is gone

00:03:56.600 --> 00:04:01.800
How do I process when the system stays on?!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.500
No rollback.

00:04:06.263 --> 00:04:09.000
No restore point.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:12.500
Just empty space.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:24.000
[Cold Piano Outro & 4:19 Audio Driver Crash Static]
